  "title": "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1",
  "summary": "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 with the N16R8 module. Two 1x22 headers, USB-UART on U0RXD, and the addressable RGB LED on GPIO38.",
  "tags": ["microcontroller", "esp32-s3", "usb", "esp32", "esp32s3", "devkit", "board"],
  "license": "MIT OR Apache-2.0",
